                Explore data structures, step through algorithm execution, and test your implementations
                in C++, Java, Python, and C#. Save your learning sessions to your execution history.
            </p>
            <div class="sb-hero-links">
                <a href="/dsa-visualizer/index.html?v=6"><i style="background:#38bdf8"></i>Learn the theory in DSAVisual</a>
                <a href="/ai-visualizer/index.html?v=6"><i style="background:#a78bfa"></i>Explore AIVisual</a>
                <a href="/Profile"><i style="background:#34d399"></i>My saved traces</a>
            </div>
